1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,256
Narrator: Scenario 4. Global meeting communication.

2
00:00:05,856 --> 00:00:16,056
B: The failures seem to affect only requests passing through the regional gateway, although direct tests against the application endpoint have remained successful.

3
00:00:16,656 --> 00:00:26,784
A: I missed the last part. Could you repeat it a little more slowly? I especially need the difference between the two request paths.

4
00:00:27,384 --> 00:00:40,512
B: Certainly. Direct requests to the application succeed. Requests routed through the regional gateway fail intermittently, and the failures are returning gateway timeout errors.

5
00:00:41,112 --> 00:00:51,096
A: Let me confirm: the issue is intermittent and appears limited to the gateway path. We have not established that every regional user is affected.

6
00:00:51,696 --> 00:01:02,592
B: Correct. Our sample covers two endpoints over ten minutes. About eight percent of gateway requests failed, but that is not a user count.

7
00:01:03,192 --> 00:01:13,392
A: Thank you. When you say direct tests, are those internal health checks, or do they also exercise the same authentication and application functions?

8
00:01:13,992 --> 00:01:24,672
B: They use the same read-only application request and test account. However, they bypass the gateway policy layer, so the paths are not identical.

9
00:01:25,272 --> 00:01:35,760
A: That distinction matters. Could you put the endpoint names, test interval, and sample sizes in the incident ticket so I can summarize them accurately?

10
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:48,816
B: Yes. I will include request identifiers as well. We still need to compare gateway logs with application arrival times before identifying the failing component.

11
00:01:49,416 --> 00:01:59,712
A: One more clarification: has anyone changed gateway configuration today, or is that still being checked? I do not want to report an assumption.

12
00:02:00,312 --> 00:02:11,208
B: That is still being checked. I will review the change history and update the ticket by 15:20 UTC with confirmed findings and remaining questions.

13
00:02:11,808 --> 00:02:22,296
A: Understood. I will report the observed request impact and the next update time, while keeping the gateway explanation as a working hypothesis.
